{{Term/Store|Soldier's Armor|Soldier's Armor|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Soldier's Armor, along with the [[Soldier's Helm]] and [[Soldier's Greaves]], comprise the [[Soldier's Set]]. The set can be purchased at [[Hateno Village]]. It appears to be composed of a pair of pauldrons, a pair of gauntlets, and a full breastplate, all of which are made of steel. It has no effect aside from increasing defense, but it can be [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] and enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]].

